@format 1
@id processing.pause
@title Pause processing
@area 5. Processing and FFmpeg
@entry input
@summary No new work is claimed; suspendable active processes are paused.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related processing.run-job
@tag processing
@tag pause

@alias runner = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LRunner

[input] Pause processing command <input>
- Receive the worklist control command @ runner.LRunnerPause(...)
> apply

[apply] Change runner state <process>
- Mark the runner inactive and suspend every active FFmpeg process that the operating system accepts @ runner.LRunnerPause(...)
> result

[result] Runner state changed <output>
=No new work is claimed; suspendable active processes are paused.
